    "description": {
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "As a SmartTools user",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I want to select the MS Teams Call layer and view its test results as points on a map, then open a detail dialog for an individual result",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "So that I can assess MS Teams call quality at the location where each test was performed.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Issue/Change Description:",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Provide MS Teams Call as a selectable map layer. MS Teams Call results must remain hidden until the layer is selected; when selected, load only matching authorised results as selectable points."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Use these Poor Quality thresholds: 0–0.99 Green; 1–9.99 Yellow; 10–24.99 Amber; 25+ Red. Selecting a point opens an MS Teams Call details dialog. It shows the summary fields Test ID, Test Result, Connection Time, Call Duration, Poor Quality, MSISDN and Test Technologies; signal and download charts with available handover markers; and a sortable, filterable detailed-sample table. Exclude label, latitude, longitude and handover-only columns from that table. Allow CSV export for the selected test."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Route Replay and advanced MS Teams display settings, including detailed routes and linked site/cell display, are out of scope. A zero-duration result or failed detail load must not show stale or misleading data."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Acceptance Criteria:",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bulletList",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given MS Teams Call has not been selected, when the map is displayed, then no MS Teams Call test-result points are shown."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given the user selects the MS Teams Call layer and authorised data is available, when the results load, then matching results are shown as selectable map points."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given an MS Teams Call point is shown, when its Poor Quality value is 0–0.99, 1–9.99, 10–24.99 or 25+, then its map colour is Green, Yellow, Amber or Red respectively."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given the user selects an MS Teams Call point, when the details load successfully, then a dialog shows the stated summary fields, signal and download charts with available handover markers, and detailed samples excluding the stated fields."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given detailed samples are shown, when the user sorts or filters a supported column, then the displayed samples reflect that operation."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given the user exports the selected test, when the export completes, then its CSV contains data for that test."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given a result has zero duration or details cannot be loaded, when the dialog is requested, then no stale or misleading details are displayed."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "rule"
        },
